---
import SimplePage from "../components/SimplePage.astro";
import { SITE } from "../consts";
import { defaultLang, type Lang } from "../i18n/ui";
import { localizePath } from "../i18n/utils";

const lang = (Astro.currentLocale ?? defaultLang) as Lang;
---

<SimplePage page="privacy">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      This page explains what data this site handles and where it goes. It's a personal site, so
      there isn't much — but a couple of features do process data, and it's worth being clear about
      them.
    </p>

    <h2>The AI idea widget</h2>
    <p>
      The interactive widgets in the{" "}
      <a href={localizePath(lang, "ai/articles/idea-breaker")}>stress-testing article</a> send the
      text you type to an <strong>AI model (OpenAI)</strong>. The request goes through my own{" "}
      <strong>MLflow server</strong>, which acts as a gateway, and the interaction — your input and
      the model's reply — is <strong>recorded as a trace</strong> in that server so I can review how
      the demo behaves and debug it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Because those traces are stored, please <strong>don't enter sensitive or personal
      information</strong> in the widget. Treat anything you type there as if it were public.
    </p>

    <h2>The contact form</h2>
    <p>
      When you use the <a href={localizePath(lang, "contact")}>contact form</a>, the name, email,
      subject and message you enter are sent to me by email (through my email provider, Namecheap)
      so I can reply. They aren't stored on the site itself; they live in my mailbox.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This site may use analytics to understand which pages are read — <strong>Google Analytics
      4</strong> and/or <strong>Plausible</strong>, depending on how it's configured. Plausible is
      cookieless; Google Analytics may set cookies. If you block cookies or use a tracker blocker,
      the site still works.
    </p>

    <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
    <p>
      This site is run by <strong>{SITE.name}</strong> ({SITE.location}). For any question about your
      data — including a request to delete a stored trace or a contact message — email{" "}
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>

    {/* TODO(author): confirm the retention details below (or replace with your own). */}
    <h2>How long data is kept</h2>
    <p>
      I keep AI traces only as long as they're useful for evaluating and improving the demo, and
      contact emails only as long as needed to handle the conversation. You can ask me to delete
      either at any time using the email above.
    </p>

    <p>If this policy changes, I'll update this page.</p>
  </div>
</SimplePage>
